---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — AICost Matrix" description="Privacy policy for aicost.apexcraftweb.com" canonical="https://aicost.apexcraftweb.com/privacy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>AICost Matrix (aicost.apexcraftweb.com) is a free, static website. We do not collect personal information. All calculations run client-side in your browser. No data is sent to our servers.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use privacy-respecting analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) that do not track individuals and do not set cookies.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. We receive a commission when you purchase through these links at no extra cost to you. See our <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: contact@apexcraftweb.com</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
